msgstr "Change"

#. Continue to {app}
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.consent.continue"
msgstr "Continue to {app}"

#. {app} will also get
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8). Arguments: {app} = the requesting app's name (never translated).
msgid "signin.consent.alsoGets"
msgstr "{app} will also get"

#. Your profile and email
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
msgid "signin.consent.profile"
msgstr "Your profile and email"

#. It gets its own id for you, and won't see your other apps or how you sign in.
#. Consent step before returning to the app (SIGN-IN.md §3.8).
