msgstr "Scan to add this key in Polaris Locker on your phone."

#. {product} is yours
#. Return step (SIGN-IN.md §3.10). Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "signin.return.yours"
msgstr "{product} is yours"

#. {tier} · in your library
#. Return step (SIGN-IN.md §3.10): the product row under "<Product> is yours". Arguments: {tier} = the tier's name (never translated).
